THIRD-PARTY CONTENT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence above covers the source code of this project only.

The Quranic text, transliteration and translations bundled under `src/data/`
and `public/data/` are derived from the `quran-json` project
(https://github.com/risan/quran-json), which sources its text from The Noble
Qur'an Encyclopedia (https://quranenc.com) and Tanzil (https://tanzil.net).
That content is distributed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Structural metadata (juz, hizb, page, ruku and sajdah boundaries) is derived
from `quran-meta` (https://github.com/quran-center/quran-meta), MIT licensed.

Tafsir content is retrieved at runtime from the Quran.com API
(https://api-docs.quran.com) and recitation audio from EveryAyah
(https://everyayah.com); both remain subject to their own terms of use and are
not redistributed by this project.

The Amiri and Cairo typefaces are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
